*.tsbuildinfo

# Stray TypeScript build sidecars next to .ts sources. A `tsc` invocation
# from inside apps/cli (instead of through `pnpm build`, which writes to
# apps/cli/dist) leaks .js / .d.ts / .js.map / .d.ts.map files into the
# source tree. They are never source-of-truth and accidentally committing
# them would silently shadow the .ts files at runtime — caught and cleaned
# in the 2026-06-21 00:40 PDT autoship tick. This makes the trap impossible.
apps/cli/src/**/*.js
apps/cli/src/**/*.d.ts
apps/cli/src/**/*.js.map
apps/cli/src/**/*.d.ts.map
